@startuml ESP Device Startup and Provisioning
title ESP Device First Boot and Operational Startup

note over ESP, MQTT
  **Technologies Used:**
  • BLE GATT - Bluetooth Low Energy Generic Attribute Profile
  • NVS - Non-Volatile Storage (ESP32 persistent memory)
  • LittleFS - Embedded filesystem for certificates
  • TLS/mTLS - Mutual TLS authentication
  • CSR - Certificate Signing Request (X.509)
  • MQTT - Secure messaging over TLS
end note

participant "ESP32 Device" as ESP
participant "Mobile App\n(BLE Client)" as App
participant "NVS Storage" as NVS
participant "LittleFS" as FS
participant "WiFi Network" as WiFi
participant "API Backend\n(CSR Signer)" as API
participant "MQTT Broker\n(TLS)" as MQTT

== Phase 1: Unconfigured State - BLE Pairing ==
ESP -> ESP: First boot - no WiFi config
ESP -> ESP: Enable BLE module
ESP -> ESP: Create GATT server with 3 characteristics:\n• SSID\n• Password\n• UserKey
ESP -> ESP: Start BLE advertising
App -> ESP: Scan and connect via BLE
App -> ESP: Write SSID to GATT characteristic
ESP -> NVS: Store SSID
App -> ESP: Write Password to GATT characteristic
ESP -> NVS: Store Password
App -> ESP: Write UserKey to GATT characteristic
ESP -> NVS: Store UserKey
ESP -> FS: Save UserKey to LittleFS\n(permanent account link)
ESP -> ESP: All credentials received
ESP -> ESP: Disable BLE connections

== Phase 2: WiFi Connection ==
ESP -> WiFi: Connect using SSID/Password from NVS
WiFi -> ESP: Connection successful
ESP -> ESP: WiFi connected

== Phase 3: TLS Provisioning ==
ESP -> FS: Read device_id (MAC)
ESP -> FS: Read device_secret
ESP -> ESP: Generate private key
ESP -> ESP: Generate CSR (Certificate Signing Request)
ESP -> API: POST /api/esp-devices/register\n{device_id, device_secret, userKey, CSR}
API -> API: Verify device_secret
API -> API: Verify userKey
API -> API: Sign CSR with CA
API -> ESP: Return signed certificate
ESP -> FS: Save client certificate to LittleFS
ESP -> FS: Save private key to LittleFS
ESP -> ESP: TLS credentials complete

== Phase 4: MQTT Connection with TLS ==
ESP -> FS: Load CA certificate
ESP -> FS: Load client certificate
ESP -> FS: Load private key
ESP -> ESP: Initialize MQTT client with TLS config
ESP -> MQTT: Connect with mutual TLS authentication
MQTT -> MQTT: Verify client certificate
MQTT -> ESP: Connection established (TLS secured)
ESP -> MQTT: Publish "conn" message
MQTT -> API: Forward connection event

== Phase 5: Normal Operation ==
ESP -> ESP: Resume sensor reading tasks
ESP -> ESP: Resume camera tasks
ESP -> ESP: Resume actuator control tasks
loop Continuous Operation
    ESP -> ESP: Read sensors (temp, humidity, etc.)
    ESP -> MQTT: Publish sensor data
    ESP -> ESP: Capture camera frame (if enabled)
    ESP -> MQTT: Publish camera frames
    ESP -> MQTT: Listen for control commands
end

@enduml